flickos-greeter (2.4~test1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The login screen shows the background picture and puts the login box
    (left, middle or right) that Settings > Login Screen chose:
    Background= and Position= in /etc/flickos/greeter over the new
    conffile /etc/xdg/flickos/greeter.conf. A picture that is missing or
    isn't a PNG or JPEG means the Dark wallpaper. --check prints both
    (design ADR-014, ADR-015).

